# `mechanisms/` is a STEP format folder, so the cad-project commit policy
# applies: only the IMPORTED sources under imported/ are committed, and no code
# can regenerate them. Everything else here — snapshots, scratch re-emits,
# anything a tool drops beside the sources — stays out of git.
#
# Note the `/*` form: ignoring the directory itself would make the negation
# dead, because git never descends into an ignored directory.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/imported/
